OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny murder of teenage girl
OL,4,Ain row over boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager was stabbed to death by her
OL,7,Fboyfriend's "jealous and obsessed"
OL,8,Fex-girlfriend, a court has heard.
OL,10,FChloe Watson Dransfield, 16, was found
OL,11,Fwith wounds to her neck and back on
OL,12,FKennerleigh Avenue in Austhorpe, Leeds,
OL,13,Fon the morning of Saturday 28 March and
OL,14,Fdied in hospital a short time later.
OL,16,FKayla Smith, 18, Archie Rycroft, 20,
OL,17,Fand Blake Dowling, 18, from Leeds, all
OL,18,Fdeny her murder, a trial at Leeds Crown
OL,19,FCourt was told.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
