OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny murder of teenage girl
OL,4,Ain row over boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmith has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fmanslaughter over Chloe's death, having
OL,8,Fadmitted to inflicting the stab wounds,
OL,9,Falthough she said she did not intend to
OL,10,Fkill or cause serious injury. The other
OL,11,Fdefendants have denied the same charge.
